WEBVTT

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:40.580
The BBA team has accepted
Team Psykick's challenge.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:47.040
Their battle arena turned out to be a remote
island completely surrounded by ocean!

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.080
What?!

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.250
No way!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.380
This way!

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:01.450
Team Psykick is after
the team's Sacred Beasts.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:03.810
If we want to protect
our Sacred Beasts,

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.770
we shouldn't be so quick
to accept their battles.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.770
Vulcan Claw!

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:22.330
Kai, Hiromi, and I took a different
path from Takao, Rei, and Max.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:26.660
We're headed to the lighthouse on the coast
to get in contact with Chairman Daitenji...

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:30.630
but a Psykick Blader blocks our path.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.770
Targets have arrived at point Q-9.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.870
There they are.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.520
Swapping displays.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.070
We've been waiting
for you, Kai Hiwatari.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.080
I'm impressed you made
it all the way out here.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.750
But you're fighting me.
Which means...

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.630
you've drawn a bad
hand, Kai Hiwatari.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:20.050
I get it. That's their plan.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:20.880
Huh?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:25.890
Their plan was to destroy all the
other bridges to lead us here.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:26.720
Kai...

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.700
The lighthouse is on the
other side of this bridge.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.600
Looks like I have to fight.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.910
Kai...

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.670
Kyoujyu, this isn't the time
to be recording data.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.600
No, I'm searching for their
Sacred Beast capture system.

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.550
Sacred Beast capture system?

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.910
It was around during Max's battle. It should be here somewhere.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:11.810
If I break that,
Kai can go all out.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.100
I get it! That's good thinking!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.110
Found it!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.610
There's no mistaking it!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.650
What are you doing?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:27.300
I'm hacking into their network
to take down the control system.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.630
I didn't know you could do that!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.660
I don't know if I can.
But I have to give it a shot.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.780
The BBA team's strongest
Blader, Kai Hiwatari.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.090
You and Dranzer are gonna
get buried six feet under!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.510
Say your prayers!

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:49.820
If you were a half-decent Blader,
you wouldn't be running your mouth.

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:51.100
What?!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.270
Let's battle!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.360
Kyoujyu! If you don't hurry
the match is gonna start!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.120
Please don't rush me,
I'm working on it.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.330
Go Shoot!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.420
Dranzer!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.630
Go! Crush him!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:34.980
Kai...

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.700
He's good.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.200
But I'm just getting warmed up!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.500
Tornado Attack!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.580
What?!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.340
Problem, Dranzer? Push me back!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.550
Is that all you've got?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.310
If you can't, then call
out your Sacred Beast...

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.520
Come on, bring it out!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.820
The Sacred Beast index
is increasing rapidly!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.360
Activate the Sacred
Beast capture system.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.240
Yes.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.540
Dranzer, summon the
Sacred Beast within you!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.540
Kyoujyu, are you done yet?

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.460
Kai's got his back
against the wall!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.430
What is that?

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.680
Abnormality detected
in the capture system!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.220
We've been hacked!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.680
What?!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.570
Yes! Now if I shut
down the program...

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.860
Can't you do something?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.910
No, we can't control it!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.920
I did it! It's a success!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.090
You're the best, Kyoujyu!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.670
Hiromi...

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.970
Kai, he took down the
Sacred Beast capture system!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.970
Don't hold back!

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.060
What?!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:41.770
I don't need my Sacred
Beast take you down!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:46.150
Shoot, where'd all this
power come from?

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.610
Just a little more, Kai!
Finish him off!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.370
Flame Saber!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.880
Crap! I won't forget this!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.260
He did it! He did it! He did it!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.170
Dranzer won!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.260
Kai!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.430
Curses...

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.910
Rei? This is Hiromi.

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:26.310
Yeah. We just got here.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.070
We can't get it work after all.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.280
It looks like the
equipment is busted.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.570
So, how's Takao?

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.410
What?

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.240
What do you mean?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:44.090
The battle ended and the
cave just fell in on itself.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.710
I think he hurt himself
more during the escape.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.620
The swelling is getting worse.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:53.020
Don't worry about me.
What about the radio?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:55.590
I told him not
to push himself!

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.640
Whatever. We're going to
try and contact the BBA.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.180
So don't move. Got it?!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:06.710
I swear. It's like he wants
me to worry about him.

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.610
Kyoujyu. You gotta
fix it no matter what!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.190
I'm on it.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.110
It sounds like the
radio won't work.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.990
I told her so.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.350
Kids of the BBA team!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:23.910
Max, Rei, and
now Kai Hiwatari!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:29.170
The world champion team doesn't
disappoint. You are all excellent Bladers.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.140
Kai?

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.270
Did he fight, too?

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:36.930
You've all done a good job
in defeating my Bladers.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:42.180
Our island battle
tournament is about to end.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.770
The next battle
is the last one.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:48.060
If we win that, you'll
let us go, right?

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.400
If you win, yes.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:54.370
Head towards the
direction of the sun.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:58.950
A Blader fit for your last
battle will be waiting for you.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.200
I wish you luck.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:07.960
The lighthouse is out, so
this is our only option.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:08.750
Yeah.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.920
Takao, can you walk?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.550
I can handle this.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.380
Don't push it.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.090
Thanks, Max.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.240
Come on, Kyoujyu!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.490
Is it fixed yet?

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.790
Don't rush me...

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.410
This is odd...

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.000
We should be able to
get a connection now.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.550
I forgot to plug it in.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.280
Over there!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.080
I know him!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.520
So he's the last one?

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.990
Good. I'll fight you.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.480
Rei. Leave this one to me.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:42.650
I can't let these guys get
away with all their cheap tricks.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.290
Let me handle this.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.750
I feel the same way.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.410
Allow me to
take care of this.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.700
But...!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.080
I don't care who battles so
hurry up and get over here!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.000
I don't care if I have to
take you both down!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.210
What?!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.460
I'll do it.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:12:59.920
Takao?

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.420
That's crazy talk. You can't
battle with your leg like it is.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:06.300
I won't know until I try.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:10.760
Don't, Takao. What if you lose
your ability to walk altogether?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.600
I'll cross that bridge
when I come to it.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.370
Don't be stupid!

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:17.440
Everyone else but
me has had a battle.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.000
I can't just leave like that!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.400
But you have to. You're injured.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.740
He's right!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.740
We can't let you do this.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.700
Leave this to us.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.280
I can't live with that!

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.790
I'm gonna take him
down, no matter what!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.750
You're crazy, trying to
battle with an injured leg.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.420
Crazy's my middle name.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.750
Takao!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:39.880
Max!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.750
We can't change his mind.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.630
He doesn't stop once he
sets his mind to something.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:55.060
I'm insulted at having to
fight a wounded Blader.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.100
You'll be the wounded one if you
can't back up that tough talk.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.480
What?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.330
He's a fool.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.400
Get the capture system on standby.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:04.530
Yes, sir!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:18.960
Let's do it.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.110
--Three!

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.360
--Two!

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.380
--One!

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:24.460
Go Shoot!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.210
Oh no!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.260
Dragoon doesn't have
the same force behind it!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:35.520
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:38.940
What?!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.690
Dragoon, stop!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.820
Now's my chance! Go!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.120
Dragoon...

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.370
Dragoon's movements are off...

00:14:56.370 --> 00:15:00.120
The stadium is moist,
so he can't control his Bey.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.130
But the other one
is moving just fine.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.570
That's it!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.130
It's sucking up the water,
which improves the grip!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.050
No way...

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.850
Darn...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.530
The Sacred Beast index
is increasing rapidly!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:32.450
I will at least take Seiryu with me!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.410
Damn!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.720
I knew it. He can't do
it with his leg injured!

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:41.830
Takao...

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.830
Go!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.930
Rei! Max!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:51.050
We got in contact with the BBA!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.010
They're coming for us!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:15:59.980
Takao!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:00.680
Hiromi!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:01.600
Stay back!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.690
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.940
Why is Takao in a battle?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.440
We tried to stop him!

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.320
He wouldn't listen to us--

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.070
And you call yourselves his friends?

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.240
Don't you care about
what happens to his leg?

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.160
Hiromi, don't!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:22.960
When Takao thinks about
battling, nothing else matters!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.420
He won't listen to anything anyone says.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.180
Really?!

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:29.380
Even though we're
so worried about him...

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.710
That's so selfish!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.220
Not quite.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.470
Look at Dragoon. It's powerless.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.610
Takao's well aware.

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:45.020
He knows he can't win like this.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.580
Then why is he battling?

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.360
It must be to protect
the Sacred Beasts.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.360
To protect them?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:59.130
Genbu and Byakko have taken a lot
of damage in their previous battles.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:01.590
If they get caught in
those capture systems,

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:04.430
they may not be
able to break free.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:07.380
So he's doing it for us...

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.930
That's just how Kinomiya is.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.560
Takao...

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.310
Finish him off!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.490
--Takao!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.990
Takao! Don't give up!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.760
Hang in there!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:43.250
The battle's not over yet!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.830
Are you really the
world champion?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.290
If you are, then prove it!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.550
Come on!

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.340
Seiryu!!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:09.730
There it is!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.520
Capture system, activated!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.420
I knew they'd use it.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.620
Takao...

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.450
We have all of Seiryu's data.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.280
There's no escape.

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:28.500
Increase the output to 3,000!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.290
Increasing output to 3,000.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.710
Hang in there, Seiryu!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.300
Go! Go!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.980
This is the end!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.040
I will not lose!!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:12.920
What?!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.170
He escaped the capture system!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.420
Yes!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:19.590
I'll never let Seiryu go!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.940
Victory Tornado!!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.420
Takao...

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:05.640
We're going to lose all the data!
Let's get out of here!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.220
Let's go.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.520
B-Bro!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:12.480
My calculations should
have been perfect.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.560
Why?

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.150
Doctor!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.750
Ow!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.080
Can't you be a little more gentle?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.580
What about you?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.250
It's your fault for battling despite
everyone telling you not to.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.880
Prepare yourself.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:45.470
Max! Rei! Do something!

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:49.890
You reap what you sow.
Keep the pressure on him, Hiromi.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.180
At least I hope you'll
stop pulling those stunts.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:53.770
I know, I know...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.250
They're here!

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.280
Takao and Hiromi!

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.950
Kyoujyu, and Kai too!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.360
They look fine!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.740
Takao!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.590
They'll be back.

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:24.840
I'm not letting those
scientists butt in anymore!

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:03.270
After escaping that island, the
Bladers with the invisible Sacred Beasts

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:06.400
Ozma and his team, have
challenged us to a battle!

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:07.940
Their target is Kai!

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:11.910
Chairman, we have to end
things with Ozma's team soon!

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:15.040
"You should go tell your <b><i>Ozmama"?</i></b>

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:17.620
What's that smug face for?!

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:20.540
You absolutely have to
watch the next episode!
